RuijieBot Windows vendor revision 0.36.0-omb.2.
Apply AFTER agent-browser-windows-stdio.patch; do not rewrite released omb.1.
The detached daemon has no console. Its console-subsystem Chromium child
otherwise allocates a visible Windows Terminal/console even when OMB hid the
outer CLI. Hide native child consoles without changing Chromium sandboxing,
stdio, process lifetime, profiles, or the upstream handle-inheritance fix.

